Package: kf6-threadweaver
Version: @DEB_THREADWEAVER_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://api.kde.org/frameworks/threadweaver/html/
Depends: qt6-base
Description: KDE Frameworks 6 ThreadWeaver runtime
 ThreadWeaver is a helper library for scheduling jobs across worker threads.
 This package contains the runtime library used by KDE applications such as
 Okular.
